Debug mode on a file with an unsupported extension (`.txt`) prints no source, only the unsupported-file-type error, and exits 1.
== args
--debug
input/raw.txt
== file input/raw.txt
plain text
== stdout
== stderr
File input/raw.txt has an unsupported file type; supported: .md, .ts, .mts, .cts, .tsx, .js, .jsx, .mjs, .cjs, .rs, .css, .json, .toml, .yaml, .yml
== exit 1
